{"3782280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OS95 Plus!", "steam_appid": 3782280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OS95 Plus!</strong> is the newest first person adventure game from Gev Creates that reimagines the 7DFPS game jam original into a multi-ending exploration game inspired by the likes of Portal and Half-Life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782280/extras/903c832075cff82ac099d058f5cc5bb4.webp?t=1785800287\" alt=\"Story\" width=480 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2006, you are tasked with beta testing the latest and greatest computer operating system, <strong>Optimal-System 95</strong>! Unfortunately for you, it turns out that your time testing at the <strong>Optimal PC Quality Assurance Facility</strong> will be indefinite as part of your duties as <strong>Quality Assurance Subject 07</strong>. With no end in sight, you must find a way to escape from the chamber and regain your freedom while meeting some very strange adversaries along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782280/extras/a2260f2586316597da9dc5b8ac4f2462.webp?t=1785800287\" alt=\"Features\" width=480 height=48 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multi-hour long single player story with twists and turns along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings to uncover that add context to the world you're in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack composed by Gev Creates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer commentary that gives insight into the creation process of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting for adult characters done by teenagers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782280/extras/a1ff96bd813db4ce20ef56f6a9591064.webp?t=1785800287\" alt=\"&amp;quot;Take my money now!&amp;quot;\" width=480 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That unfortunately isn't possible as this is a free release but if you really want to make a poor financial investment by supporting me, you can purchase the original soundtrack composed for the game.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OS95 Plus!</strong> is the newest first person adventure game from Gev Creates that reimagines the 7DFPS game jam original into a multi-ending exploration game inspired by the likes of Portal and Half-Life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782280/extras/903c832075cff82ac099d058f5cc5bb4.webp?t=1785800287\" alt=\"Story\" width=480 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2006, you are tasked with beta testing the latest and greatest computer operating system, <strong>Optimal-System 95</strong>! Unfortunately for you, it turns out that your time testing at the <strong>Optimal PC Quality Assurance Facility</strong> will be indefinite as part of your duties as <strong>Quality Assurance Subject 07</strong>. With no end in sight, you must find a way to escape from the chamber and regain your freedom while meeting some very strange adversaries along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782280/extras/a2260f2586316597da9dc5b8ac4f2462.webp?t=1785800287\" alt=\"Features\" width=480 height=48 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multi-hour long single player story with twists and turns along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings to uncover that add context to the world you're in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack composed by Gev Creates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer commentary that gives insight into the creation process of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting for adult characters done by teenagers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782280/extras/a1ff96bd813db4ce20ef56f6a9591064.webp?t=1785800287\" alt=\"&amp;quot;Take my money now!&amp;quot;\" width=480 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That unfortunately isn't possible as this is a free release but if you really want to make a poor financial investment by supporting me, you can purchase the original soundtrack composed for the game.</p>", "short_description": "OS95 Plus! is the newest first person puzzle adventure game from Gev Creates. You're stuck in a mysterious facility and are forced to indefinitely partake in software testing. You must navigate rooms and solve puzzles to escape and uncover the truth behind the experiment.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782280/353aa07fb5bb6328ac07b99a8033c7a529614da3/header.jpg?t=1785800287", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782280/0ac8e196695ef1c70d8cf2d27492734956989465/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785800287", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782280/0ac8e196695ef1c70d8cf2d27492734956989465/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785800287", "website": "https://optimal.neocities.org"